---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sell Ready AI – Gabriel Alisasis" description="23 custom landing pages and a searchable podcast archive, built as a full content platform inside a Shopify theme.">
  <div class="page-top-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <section id="case">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="breadcrumb-head">
        <a href="/work">← All work</a>
      </div>
      <div class="case-list">
        <article class="case reveal">
          <div class="case-top">
            <div class="case-shot">
              <div class="chrome">
                <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="urlbar">sellready.ai</span>
              </div>
              <img class="zoomable" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1200" height="750" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                   alt="Sell Ready AI homepage with the headline Scale Beyond Bottlenecks and a website-input call to action over a blue gradient">
            </div>
            <div class="case-info">
              <div class="case-idx">Case 03 / 04</div>
              <h3>Sell Ready AI – 23 landing pages and a podcast platform, inside Shopify</h3>
              <p>An AI-systems consultancy whose Shopify theme had to behave like a full marketing site: two dozen service and resource pages, a searchable podcast archive, and a video-led homepage – all in Liquid.</p>
              <blockquote class="pullquote">Shopify gives you a storefront. Everything that makes this feel like a content platform had to be built.</blockquote>
              <dl class="spec">
                <div><dt>Sector</dt><dd>B2B consultancy</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Stack</dt><dd>Shopify Liquid · JS · CSS</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Scale</dt><dd>87 sections · 23 templates</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Built</dt><dd>Podcast archive, search, tags</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <div class="case-actions">
                <a class="visit-btn" href="https://sellready.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit site ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

            <div class="case-body">
              <div class="pao">
                <div class="pao-col pao-problem">
                  <h4>Problem</h4>
                  <p>The business sells consulting, not products – but the site runs on Shopify. Every service page, resource, and podcast episode needed a structure the platform doesn't ship with, and the episode pages in particular had to work as genuine editorial content rather than product listings.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pao-col pao-approach">
                  <h4>Approach</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Built a library of <strong>87 Liquid sections</strong> composed into <strong>23 custom page templates</strong> – service pages, assessments, checklists, and a virtual deal room.</li>
                    <li>Designed the episode page as a two-column editorial layout with sidebar widgets, then made the whole thing behave on mobile.</li>
                    <li>Wrote an <strong>aggregate podcast archive</strong> with client-side search, tag filtering, and the full back catalogue.</li>
                    <li>Added click-to-play video infrastructure for the homepage hero, so the page doesn't pay for an embed until someone presses play.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="pao-col pao-outcome">
                  <h4>Outcome</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>A Shopify theme running <strong>23 bespoke landing pages</strong> plus a working content platform.</li>
                    <li>Podcast archive with search and tags shipped end to end.</li>
                    <li>A long tail of real mobile fixes – breadcrumb overflow, stacking icon rows, list markers breaking onto their own line, video ordering in step cards.</li>
                    <li>Changes tracked in Git against a live theme, so every fix is reviewable and reversible.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="diagram-wrap">
                <div class="cap">Fig. 04 – theme architecture</div>
                <svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 900 200" role="img"
                     aria-label="Diagram of the Shopify theme architecture: content in the Shopify admin feeds a library of eighty-seven Liquid sections, which compose into twenty-three custom page templates, plus a podcast episode template feeding an archive page with client-side search and tag filtering.">
                  <text class="dg-head" x="8" y="16">CONTENT</text>
                  <rect class="dg-box" x="8" y="26" width="170" height="58"/>
                  <text class="dg-label" x="22" y="50">Shopify admin</text>
                  <text class="dg-sub" x="22" y="66">pages · blogs · metafields</text>

                  <text class="dg-head" x="240" y="16">COMPOSITION</text>
                  <rect class="dg-box dg-box-accent" x="240" y="26" width="170" height="58"/>
                  <text class="dg-label" x="254" y="50">Liquid sections</text>
                  <text class="dg-sub" x="254" y="66">87 in the library</text>

                  <text class="dg-head" x="472" y="16">OUTPUT</text>
                  <rect class="dg-box" x="472" y="26" width="250" height="58"/>
                  <text class="dg-label" x="486" y="50">23 page templates</text>
                  <text class="dg-sub" x="486" y="66">services · assessments · deal room</text>

                  <path class="dg-flow" style="--len:62" d="M178 55 L240 55"/>
                  <path class="dg-flow" style="--len:62" d="M410 55 L472 55"/>

                  <rect class="dg-box" x="240" y="112" width="250" height="58"/>
                  <text class="dg-label" x="254" y="136">Episode template</text>
                  <text class="dg-sub" x="254" y="152">editorial layout · sidebar widgets</text>

                  <rect class="dg-box dg-box-accent" x="530" y="112" width="250" height="58"/>
                  <text class="dg-label" x="544" y="136">Podcast archive</text>
                  <text class="dg-sub" x="544" y="152">search · tags · full catalogue</text>

                  <path class="dg-flow" style="--len:28" d="M325 84 L325 112"/>
                  <path class="dg-flow" style="--len:40" d="M490 141 L530 141"/>
                </svg>
              </div>

              <div class="stack-row">
                <span class="pill">Shopify Liquid</span><span class="pill">JavaScript</span><span class="pill">CSS</span>
                <span class="pill">Git</span><span class="pill">Responsive design</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
